<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal sets 6.50 pct stock div, record Feb 5.</title>
<headline>Rizal sets 6.50 pct stock div, record Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp said on Friday its board had approved a 6.50 percent stock dividend to be given to shareholders on record as of February 5.</p>
<p>The bank told the Philippine Stock Exchange that the ex-dividend date is set for January 27.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
